  npcName: Skeleton Guy
  npcPotrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a49a3e263ceb14544aa897a69264c811, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Oh\u2026 a living one."
  - You smell loud. Hearts always do.
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m not hungry. I misplaced my stomach a few centuries
    ago."
  - Most people who come here scream first, run second, and die third.
  - "You skipped the screaming. That\u2019s new."
  - "I\u2019ll be here when you return\u2026"
  - "or when you don\u2019t..."
